	(text "Ground: all 18 Zorro GND pins (incl. pin 91)\nto the ground plane. Zorro +5V (5,6), +12V (10),\n-5V (8), -12V (20) deliberately NOT connected\n(brief: no operating power from Zorro pins)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 325.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04e48d83-d782-56ef-b351-ec7630a1738f")
	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES (summary; full analysis in docs/stage2/sheet1-design-notes.md)\n1. /SLAVEn must assert <= 35 ns after /AS and negate <= 50 ns after /AS rises (Zorro III spec App. K, Zorro II\n   compatibility). Path: U102 (tpd <= 4.1 ns) + FPGA combinational (datasheet floor 7.24 ns, -4; final value from\n   Diamond STA) + U104 (tpd <= 4.4 ns) + R117 + PCB. Budget closes only if the FPGA segment is <= ~20 ns.\n2. XRDY provision is fitted. HDL default mode inserts wait states via XRDY until zero-wait timing is measured.\n3. Power-off isolation: U101/U102 Ioff, U103/U104 VCC isolation + Ioff, U105 Ioff. With the carrier unpowered,\n   /SLAVEn and /CFGOUTn float: depends on A2000 backplane pull-ups (open concern C-03).\n4. Interfaces to sheet 2 (FPGA) are hierarchical labels: ZB_* (buffered Zorro inputs), ZF_* (FPGA-driven\n   outputs), LD0-LD15 (local data bus). Power nets +3V3 / +5V_BUS come from sheet 5 (not yet drawn).\n5. Not yet validated: no ERC-clean claim implies electrical or timing correctness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 214.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "21432bbc-ecac-5041-8f6d-a96209c0cac7")
	)
	(text "U104 has no ~{OE}: outputs follow A inputs, held HIGH\n(inactive) by 2.2k pull-ups while the FPGA is\nunconfigured. DIR=H (A->B). /SLAVEn path: see\nsheet notes (35 ns budget)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f8668de-6147-541f-87a7-469ac720c5f0")
	)
	(text "~{OE} tied low: inputs always enabled.\nOutputs drive FPGA inputs only.\n5.5 V-tolerant inputs; Ioff = no backfeed\nwhen +3V3 is off (TI SCAS699C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f931b9c-ecc4-5e4b-b1dd-b76fcea45ae3")
	)
	(text "Open-drain (wired-OR per Zorro spec): /INT2, /INT6, XRDY.\nFPGA drives input LOW to assert. XRDY is kept fitted\n(wait-state provision; zero-wait timing is NOT assumed\nuntil measured). /OVR, /DTACK paths DNP (automatic\nDTACK used). Spare channel 6: input tied high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 281.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "693703c1-8527-5b98-8921-c1a1458bd455")
	)
	(text "SAFE START-UP DEFAULTS. MachXO2 I/O are tri-stated with a weak pull-DOWN (IPD 30-305 uA) before/during\nconfiguration (Lattice FPGA-DS-02056-4.7). 2.2k pull-ups hold every Zorro output INACTIVE: node >= 3.0 V - 2.2k x 305 uA = 2.33 V > VIH 2.0 V.\nDIR pull-down keeps U103 pointing Zorro->local (never drives the Zorro bus)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a05d82b-9e72-5410-bda8-c2ce86d8df0f")
	)
	(text "TEMPORARY: remove these two PWR_FLAGs when sheet 5 (power) sources +3V3 / +5V_BUS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 365.76 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c1c55e2a-11b3-5b10-9f0f-4857a7b40dd5")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS (bring-up timing: measure /AS->/SLAVEn at the edge connector and per stage; /BERR monitors bus collisions)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ded7cfe8-80a9-5425-9b54-98b6ad379ae4")
	)
	(text "DECOUPLING: one 100 nF per supply pin, placed at the pin (PCB); 10 uF bulk per rail on this sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
