	(text "B port = Zorro D0-D15 (VCCB = +5V_BUS): drives full 5 V levels.\nA port = local bus LD0-LD15 (VCCA = +3V3).\nDIR=H: A->B (card drives Zorro, reads). DIR=L: B->A.\n~{OE}=H: both ports Hi-Z (isolation).\nBus-hold on all data inputs: no pull resistors (TI SCES635B).\nVCC isolation: either supply at 0 V -> all outputs Hi-Z.\nRN101-RN104: 22R series damping, value TBV by SI measurement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
